    - gx
    - Twist speed
  - - input
    - wearable1
    - gy
    - Tilt speed
  - - input
    - wearable1
    - gz
    - Turn speed
  - - input
    - wearable1
    - still
    - Still (1 while still)
  - - input
    - wearable1
